{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はみなみちゃんとお昼ご飯食べに行ったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お蕎麦！天ぷら！カタラーナ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/22/2182073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/22/2182073/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/22/2182073/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高かよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/22/2182073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達のつぐれなちゃんと\n週に1回ペースで時間見つけて会ってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回予定よりちょっと多めに会って\n話し込んじゃう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話し足りない！毎回毎回！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プライベートのはなしもするけど、\nお仕事のはなしもたくさんするの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルだけどアーティスト活動をするれなと\nアイドルだけどモデルもやらせてもらってる私！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似てる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれがいろいろな悩みあるから\n2人で話したりして解決することも\nあるんだー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"刺激をくれる\n優しくて面白くて可愛くて大好きな友達！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなれながもう1人のモデルの子と\nグループでやってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「れいん」のうたがすごく好きなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は「17歳」と「同じ月を見てた」が\n特に好きで普段も聞くし\n音楽をかけながら歌ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞もメロディーも完璧に覚えたよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"検索したら出てくるから\n皆さんにもきいてほしいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も誰かの心や耳に残る\n誰かの考えや悩みを救うことのできる\n歌を歌いたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/22/2182073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/22/2182073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーとーなーっーぽーいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/22/2182073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひめちゃんとみなみちゃんと\n墓場、女子高生みてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想はまたあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽がんばってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいー"}],"source":"archive"}